   "source": [
    "## Correlation Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "In this section, we investigate the relationship between Food Microbiome Exposure (FME) and microbiome diversity metrics.\n",
    "\n",
    "We begin by examining the correlation between the daily FME score and Shannon diversity, which is a commonly used measure of microbiome diversity."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "896cbf24",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Pearson Correlation: -0.0406\n",
      "P-value: 0.3776\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Correlation between FME and Shannon Diversity\n",
    "\n",
    "correlation, p_value = pearsonr(\n",
    "    df[\"fme_score_daily\"],\n",
    "    df[\"shannon_diversity\"]\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Pearson Correlation: {correlation:.4f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"P-value: {p_value:.4f}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "82df9973",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Visualization of FME and Shannon Diversity\n",
    "\n",
    "The following scatter plot illustrates the relationship between daily Food Microbiome Exposure (FME) scores and Shannon diversity values across all samples.\n",
    "\n",
    "A regression line is added to help visualize the overall trend."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "417bcdbe",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 960x600 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "plt.figure(figsize=(8, 5))\n",
    "\n",
    "sns.regplot(\n",
    "    data=df,\n",
    "    x=\"fme_score_daily\",\n",
    "    y=\"shannon_diversity\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.title(\"FME Score vs Shannon Diversity\")\n",
    "plt.xlabel(\"Daily FME Score\")\n",
    "plt.ylabel(\"Shannon Diversity\")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8103c02e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Insight\n",
    "\n",
    "The relationship between FME score and Shannon diversity appears to be weak.\n",
    "\n",
    "Although FME values vary considerably across samples, Shannon diversity remains relatively stable.\n",
    "\n",
    "The nearly flat regression line suggests little to no linear association between the two variables."
   ]
  },
