   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c810771e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Comparison Between Low and High FME Groups\n",
    "\n",
    "To further investigate the relationship between Food Microbiome Exposure (FME) and microbiome diversity, samples were divided into two groups based on the median FME score.\n",
    "\n",
    "Shannon diversity distributions were then compared between the groups."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "f41047e0",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/plain": [
       "fme_group\n",
       "High FME    238\n",
       "Low FME     237\n",
       "Name: count, dtype: int64"
      ]
     },
     "execution_count": 899,
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "execute_result"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# Create FME groups based on median value\n",
    "\n",
    "median_fme = df[\"fme_score_daily\"].median()\n",
    "\n",
    "df[\"fme_group\"] = np.where(\n",
    "    df[\"fme_score_daily\"] >= median_fme,\n",
    "    \"High FME\",\n",
    "    \"Low FME\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "df[\"fme_group\"].value_counts()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4cd5a63d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Shannon Diversity by FME Group\n",
    "\n",
    "The following boxplot compares Shannon diversity values between samples with low and high Food Microbiome Exposure."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "204cd52c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 840x600 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "plt.figure(figsize=(7,5))\n",
    "\n",
    "sns.boxplot(\n",
    "    data=df,\n",
    "    x=\"fme_group\",\n",
    "    y=\"shannon_diversity\"\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.title(\"Shannon Diversity by FME Group\")\n",
    "plt.xlabel(\"FME Group\")\n",
    "plt.ylabel(\"Shannon Diversity\")\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e47757c7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Insight\n",
    "\n",
    "The distributions of Shannon diversity are similar in both FME groups.\n",
    "\n",
    "No clear difference in diversity is observed between low and high FME exposure levels."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4dbbac42",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Statistical Test\n",
    "\n",
    "A Mann–Whitney U test was performed to evaluate whether Shannon diversity differs significantly between the two FME groups."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "2ac365d7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Mann-Whitney U Statistic: 28228.0\n",
      "P-value: 0.9869319368980619\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "high_fme = df[df[\"fme_group\"] == \"High FME\"][\"shannon_diversity\"]\n",
    "low_fme = df[df[\"fme_group\"] == \"Low FME\"][\"shannon_diversity\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "stat, p_value = mannwhitneyu(high_fme, low_fme)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Mann-Whitney U Statistic:\", stat)\n",
    "print(\"P-value:\", p_value)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f69d978e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Insight\n",
    "\n",
    "No significant difference was found between the low and high FME groups (p = 0.987).\n",
    "\n",
    "This suggests that FME levels are not associated with differences in Shannon diversity in this dataset."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "667102e9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Adjusted Regression Analysis\n",
    "\n",
    "To account for potential dietary confounders, an additional regression model was fitted including nutrient intake variables.\n",
    "\n",
    "This allows evaluation of the association between FME and Shannon diversity while controlling for dietary factors."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "1c7c936f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "                            OLS Regression Results                            \n",
      "==============================================================================\n",
      "Dep. Variable:      shannon_diversity   R-squared:                       0.027\n",
