   "source": [
    "[col for col in merged_df.columns if \"fme\" in col.lower()]"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "26a2c105",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "To better capture the delayed effects of nutrition on the microbiome, additional stability measures were created.\n",
    "\n",
    "Besides the daily FME score, we generated:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 3-day moving average\n",
    "- 5-day moving average\n",
    "- Weighted moving average emphasizing recent days\n",
    "\n",
    "These variables provide a more biologically realistic representation of microbiome stability over time."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
